OL,3,GNEWSAPloughing Championships celebrate
OL,4,Afarming tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 240 competitors gathered in
OL,7,FAtherstone for the 75th British Annual
OL,8,FPloughing Championships.
OL,10,FThe event brought together ploughmen
OL,11,Fand women from across the country to
OL,12,Fcompete for national titles and
OL,13,Fshowcase their skills.
OL,15,FSue Frith, chief executive of the
OL,16,FSociety of Ploughmen, said the
OL,17,Fchampionships helped bring the farming
OL,18,Fcommunity together and gave visitors an
OL,19,Finsight into the country's agricultural
OL,20,Fheritage.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
